%% Full Aura architecture — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart TD
  Sources[Market / information sources] --> Data[Data Engine]
  Data --> Features[Feature Engine]
  Features --> Regime[Deterministic Market Regime Engine]
  Regime --> Pods
  Features --> Scanner[Market Scanner]
  Scanner --> Pods[Strategies domain / five versioned Pods]
  Pods --> Candidates[Candidates / triage]
  Candidates --> Committee[Selective Investment Committee]
  Knowledge[Knowledge Library] --> Committee
  Router[Model Router] <--> Committee
  Committee --> Proposal[Trade Proposal]
  Proposal --> PM[Portfolio Manager]
  PM --> Permission[Mode permission]
  Permission --> Risk[Deterministic Risk Engine]
  Risk -->|Approve or resize + reservation| OM[Order Manager / submit gate]
  Risk -->|Reject| Shadow[Shadow Portfolios]
  OM --> BI[Broker Interface]
  BI --> Paper[Paper Broker Adapter]
  Paper --> Receipts[Execution receipts]
  Receipts --> Ledger[Canonical Portfolio Ledger]
  Ledger --> PM
  Ledger --> Monitor[Position Monitor]
  Data --> Monitor
  Monitor --> Exit[Exit Proposal]
  Exit --> PM
  Shadow --> Research[Backtests / Research League]
  Research --> Knowledge
  Research --> Review[Owner qualification / activation policy]
  Review --> Pods
  Research -.->|Shared evaluation port only| Pods
  Health[Entry Halt / Full Kill / Health Gates] -.-> OM
  Orch[Durable orchestration] -.-> Scanner
  Orch -.-> Monitor
  Audit[Audit / reports / UI] -.-> Ledger
  Committee -.-> Audit
  Risk -.-> Audit
